<title>HONG KONG: Hong Kong leadership ballot count.</title>
<headline>Hong Kong leadership ballot count.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the running total of the count on Wednesday in the ballot to select the Chief Executive to lead Hong Kong upon its handover to China in the middle of next year:</p>
<p>    - Tung Chee-hwa   313</p>
<p>    - Yang Ti Liang    41</p>
<p>    - Peter Woo	  36</p>
<p>The 400 members of the Selection Committee cast their ballots earlier on Wednesday. The first candidate to reach 201 votes wins.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
